  "extinction_rule": "After advancing both players' joint move, a player with neither a living worker nor a tree is extinct if no recruitment center remains or cash is below the cheaper recruit cost (30). EpisodeSteps=300 includes the initial state; normal final state is step 299. Snapshots do not identify which collision or action caused extinction, and these cases do not establish the optimal alternative.",
  "formal_551k_caliber": "Rows labeled 551k, 1,000 per arm. Bigeval emits sa and sb but drops end_step. With the registered horizon, nonnegative scores on both sides mean normal limit (299), a negative candidate score implies candidate extinction at sa+301. No validation row in these archives had a negative opponent score. Negative score at step 299 is counted separately."
